      "content": "You should absolutely avoid using misleading tactics, as deceptive marketing can quickly harm your brand reputation and lead to trust issues with your savvy audience. Instead of \"limited stock,\" focus your urgency on the \"pre-order window\" or \"launch access,\" if applicable. You can create manufactured urgency around a specific *benefit* or a *launch attribute*, rather than the physical inventory level, to drive interest truthfully.",
